    "video": {
      "name": "Keto Beef and Broccoli Recipe",
      "description": "There are hundreds of keto dishes, but only a handful will become tried-and-true keto staples. Our keto beef and broccoli stir fry recipe is the perfect example of this. Not only will it satisfy your craving for Chinese takeout, but it is so easy-to-make and delicious that you’ll feel like a professional chef after each flavorful bite.\n\nJust hold sugar, let the keto-friendly ingredients work their magic, and you’ll experience exactly what I mean with this simple keto beef and broccoli recipe.\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n16 ounce flat iron steak\n1/4 cup soy sauce, or coconut aminos\n2 teaspoon fresh garlic, chopped\n1 teaspoon fresh ginger, peeled and grated\n8 ounce broccoli, cut into small florets\n1/4 cup avocado oil\n1/4 tsp. xanthan gum\n1 teaspoon toasted sesame oil\n1 teaspoon fish sauce\n\nNutrition Summary:\nMakes a total of 4 servings of Keto Beef and Broccoli. Each serving comes out to be 414 calories, 29.7g fats, 3.5g net carbs, and 31.1g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
